msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Preguntas frecuentes"

msgid ""
"I can't find an addon I download before when this was the Asset Library, was "
"everything old removed?"
msgstr ""
"No encuentro un complemento que descargué cuando esto era la Biblioteca de "
"assets. ¿Se ha eliminado todo el contenido anterior?"

msgid ""
"I consider my addon in the early alpha or beta stage of development, can I "
"upload it?"
msgstr ""
"Mi complemento está en una fase inicial de desarrollo, alfa o beta. ¿Puedo "
"subirlo?"

msgid ""
"Yes. You are allowed to upload your addon even if you feel it hasn't reached "
"1.0 functionality. However we do ask that whatever releases you put on the "
"store are functional. For example, say you've only implemented 4 of your 10 "
"features but those 4 do work (doesn't have to be bug free), that is "
"functional. In comparison, an addon that adds numerous buttons to the editor "
"that don't do anything if you click on them is non-functional."
msgstr ""
"Sí. Puedes subir tu complemento aunque consideres que todavía no ha "
"alcanzado la funcionalidad de la versión 1.0. Sin embargo, te pedimos que "
"las versiones que publiques en la tienda sean funcionales. Por ejemplo, si "
"solo has implementado 4 de tus 10 funcionalidades, pero esas 4 funcionan "
"(aunque tengan errores), el complemento se considera funcional. En cambio, "
"un complemento que añade numerosos botones al editor que no hacen nada al "
"hacer clic en ellos no se considera funcional."

msgid "Can I submit an addon that only works in Godot 3?"
msgstr "¿Puedo enviar un complemento que solo funcione en Godot 3?"

msgid ""
"I have an addon with a Godot 3 and Godot 4 version, do I submit it twice?"
msgstr ""
"Tengo un complemento con una versión para Godot 3 y otra para Godot 4. ¿Debo "
"enviarlo dos veces?"

msgid "Is there a size limit?"
msgstr "¿Hay un límite de tamaño?"
